  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note-member",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "MEMBER PORTAL — does not exist yet. These are proposals.\n\nThe web can hold what a phone screen cannot: eighteen weeks of squat top sets on one line, a full scan history, a nutrition target with its reason beside it.\n\nDensity is deliberately NOT the Terminal direction used in Studio. A member opens this occasionally, often on a phone, and wants clarity rather than the whole position at once."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-coach",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1080,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "COACH PORTAL — does not exist yet. These are proposals.\n\nBuilt on tables that already exist: sessions, coach_requests, program_templates, session_approvals.\n\nSame type system as Studio, lower density. A trainer checks this between clients, not all morning."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-studio",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2380,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "STUDIO — the hub, and the only one of the three that exists as code today.\n\nEvery board here answers a question that needs more than one system at once. Note these mockups predate the Terminal direction now live in studio-web, so the rail still shows the old grouping.\n\nFigures are illustrative. Dashes are deliberate: they mark what the console would genuinely not know."
    }
  ],
